# Agent Sessions

Handoff log so a new agent knows what recent agents did — without re-reading everything.

- One file per session: `YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md` (copy `_TEMPLATE.md`).
- Prepend a one-line summary to `INDEX.md` (newest first).
- Write only when something meaningful changed; skip pure Q&A or read-only sessions.
- Never rewrite past entries.
